# WATER-BUOYANCY-RIVER: a barrel (the Capsule primitive rolled onto world X: Collider Capsule R 25, HalfHeight 25, axis Y; Mass 70, ~43 % draft; Buoyancy Collider) on a river
# (WaterBody Type River, RiverFlowSpeed 150 cm/s, Drag 1.5 1/s) is carried downstream by the current: the drag of
# its pontoons pulls it to the water's velocity (WaterQueryResult::Velocity).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Water_River_Buoyancy.desce
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,600,-1200
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.4,1
Когда run Action "Simulate"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 4_barrel_drift через 5 с бочка снесена ниже по течению (≈ 5-7 м от точки старта), плывёт, не тонет
